Package: libgtk4-frdp-4.0-0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK 4 widget for embedding FreeRDP 3 remote desktops
 gtk4-frdp provides FrdpDisplay, a GTK 4 widget that shows a remote desktop
 over RDP using FreeRDP 3: keyboard and mouse input, dynamic resolution,
 clipboard, audio and certificate/login prompts. Each connection runs on its
 own thread, so connecting never blocks the user interface.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: gir1.2-gtkfrdp-4.0
Section: introspection
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${gir:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK 4 widget for embedding FreeRDP 3 remote desktops - introspection data
 gtk4-frdp provides FrdpDisplay, a GTK 4 widget that shows a remote desktop
 over RDP using FreeRDP 3.
 .
 This package contains the GObject Introspection data (GtkFrdp-4.0) used by
 Python, JavaScript and other languages.

